<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Remove the welcome message from the current channel so that new users joining won't see one."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_question}>{dgettext("help_commands", "When to Use It")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Use it when the welcome text is out of date and you have nothing to put in its place yet. If you only want new text, use %{command} with the new message. It replaces the old one in one step.",
    command: "/setwelcome"
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/clearwelcome")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Clears the welcome message that is shown to users when they join the current channel. After clearing, no welcome message is displayed until a new one is set with"
  )} <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "/setwelcome")}</code>.
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "The command acts on the channel you are viewing. The welcome is also deleted from storage, so it does not come back later. You see a confirmation line that names the channel. Other members get no message about the change."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Typing %{command} with no text does the same thing as this command.",
    command: "/setwelcome"
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "You must be a channel operator or owner")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Must be used inside a channel")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Half-operators cannot use this command")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Clearing a channel that has no welcome message is not an error")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "The command takes no parameters. Anything you type after it is ignored."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/clearwelcome")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="channel-welcome-message">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Channel Welcome Message")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-setwelcome">{dgettext("help_commands", "/setwelcome")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-special-messages">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Special Messages")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
